📝 Todo List Web App JS

A simple and interactive Todo List Application built using HTML, CSS, and Vanilla JavaScript.
This project allows users to add, mark as completed, and remove tasks in a clean and user-friendly interface.


#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
🚀 Features

➕ Add new todo items

✅ Mark tasks as completed (line-through effect)

❌ Remove tasks from the list

🖥️ Simple and responsive UI

📜 Dynamic DOM manipulation using JavaScript


#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure of the app

CSS3 – Styling and layout

JavaScript (ES6) – Functionality & interactivity

#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
📂 Project Structure
todo-list-app/
│
├── index.html     # Main HTML file
├── stylee.css     # Styling file
├── file.js        # JavaScript logic
└── README.md      # Project documentation


#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
⚙️ How It Works

Enter a task in the input field.

Click Add Item to insert it into the list.

Click Done to mark the task as completed.

Click Remove to delete the task.

#---------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🎯 Learning Objectives

This project helps beginners understand:

DOM manipulation

Event handling

Form submission handling

Dynamic element creation

Event delegation

